      "text": "A duplicate message makes the INSERT fail\n(primary key violation), so the whole\ntransaction rolls back and the message is discarded.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Qt9Oc7Y9s8JiWxLnTHDQ7",
      "originalText": "A duplicate message makes the INSERT fail\n(primary key violation), so the whole\ntransaction rolls back and the message is discarded.",
